    {
      "id": 203,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Snapshot Count per VM",
      "description": "Snapshots stored per VM. A rising curve = retention is working. A flat line that then drops = a snapshot was pruned (normal). A disappearing line = the VM fell off the backup list.",
